Date} ({days} day(s))</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 18px;color:#64748b;font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid #e8edf3\">Rejected by</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px;text-align:right;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-top:1px solid #e8edf3\">{supervisorName}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 18px;color:#64748b;font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid #e8edf3\">Reason</td><td style=\"padding:12px 18px;text-align:right;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-top:1px solid #e8edf3\">{reason}</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 38px 36px\"><a href=\"{appUrl}\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;background-color:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#dc2626,#1e1b4b 260%);color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:99px\">View leave request</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"margin-top:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:12px\">This is an automated Timesheet notification.</div></td></tr></table></body>"
